WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.866 --> 00:00:05.601
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:05.602 --> 00:00:06.568
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF RUBIO HAS BEEN

00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:10.906
RAISING ALARM OVER THE STATE OF

00:00:10.907 --> 00:00:11.673
FLORIDA IRREGULARITIES FOR QUITE

00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:12.541
SOME TIME TO THANK YOU VERY MUCH

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:14.443
FOR COMING ON.

00:00:14.444 --> 00:00:16.145
I KNOW YOU ARE A SENATE

00:00:16.146 --> 00:00:16.979
REPRESENTATIVE FOR THE STATE OF

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.114
FLORIDA, AND YOU ARE FROM

00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:21.183
FLORIDA, BUT OBJECTIVELY AS YOU

00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:22.751
CAN, WHAT IS THE CORE PROBLEM

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:24.153
WITH ELECTIONS IN FLORIDA?

00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:26.755
&gt;&gt; THERE ISN'T.

00:00:26.756 --> 00:00:28.123
65 OF 67 COUNTIES DID IT RIGHT.

00:00:28.124 --> 00:00:30.192
MIAMI DANE COUNTY IS RIGHT ON

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:32.361
BORDER WITH BROWARD, THEY GOT

00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:33.762
ALL THE VOTES AND ON TIME.

00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:35.764
AND THEN THEY DID THE RECOUNT ON

00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:36.065
TIME.

00:00:36.066 --> 00:00:38.567
IT IS LARGELY FOCUSED ON TWO

00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:39.368
COUNTIES, ONE IN PARTICULAR,

00:00:39.369 --> 00:00:40.836
BROWARD COUNTY, WHERE YOU HAVE

00:00:40.837 --> 00:00:43.238
AN ELECTION DIRECTOR, WHO IS

00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:45.374
DONE THIS IN THE PAST.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:46.775
WHEN SOMEONE -- A PERFECT

00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:47.609
EXAMPLE OF THE PROVISIONAL

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.577
BALLOTS, RIGHT, THE PEOPLE THAT

00:00:48.578 --> 00:00:49.645
SHOW UP AND VOTE, YOU DON'T SHOW

00:00:49.646 --> 00:00:51.547
UP IN THE SYSTEM, THEY LET YOU

00:00:51.548 --> 00:00:52.781
VOTE, BUT THEY PUT YOUR VOTE IN

00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:54.950
AN ENVELOPE, AND THEN ACTUALLY

00:00:54.951 --> 00:00:55.551
VERIFY YOU.

00:00:55.552 --> 00:00:57.386
SHE DECIDED TO TAKE 205 AND

00:00:57.387 --> 00:00:58.587
COUNT THEM ON HER OWN WITHOUT

00:00:58.588 --> 00:00:59.955
COMMITTING THEM THE RIGHT WAY TO

00:00:59.956 --> 00:01:01.957
THE PROVISIONAL -- TO THE

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:02.458
CANVASSING BOARD.

00:01:02.459 --> 00:01:03.425
WHEN THAT WAS DISCOVERED, SHE

00:01:03.426 --> 00:01:05.427
SAID ALL RIGHT, I WILL GIVE IT

00:01:05.428 --> 00:01:06.628
TO THE CANVASSING BOARD, BUT SHE

00:01:06.629 --> 00:01:07.563
HAD ALREADY SEPARATED THE

00:01:07.564 --> 00:01:08.363
BALLOTS FROM THE ENVELOPES.

00:01:08.364 --> 00:01:11.166
THEY FOUND 20 TO BE INVALID, BUT

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:12.367
THERE IS NO WAY TO MATCH OF THE

00:01:12.368 --> 00:01:13.102
BALLOTS TO THE ENVELOPE WHEN YOU

00:01:13.103 --> 00:01:15.137
SEPARATE THEM, SO SHE SUBMITTED

00:01:15.138 --> 00:01:17.372
205 VOTE TO THE STATE OUT OF

00:01:17.373 --> 00:01:19.308
THAT BATCH, 20 OF THEM, AT LEAST

00:01:19.309 --> 00:01:21.743
20 OF THEM, OR INVALID VOTES.

00:01:21.744 --> 00:01:23.145
NOW SHE CLAIMS ARE NOT PART OF

00:01:23.146 --> 00:01:23.946
THE COUNT, WHICH CONTRADICTS

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:26.281
WHAT HER LAWYER SAID A FEW DAYS

00:01:26.282 --> 00:01:26.548
AGO.

00:01:26.549 --> 00:01:27.349
WHEN SOMEONE THAT INCOMPETENT IS

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:28.550
SITTING ON THOUSANDS OF BALLOTS,

00:01:28.551 --> 00:01:30.786
WE DON'T HOW MANY THERE ARE, SHE

00:01:30.787 --> 00:01:31.687
IS NOT REGULARLY RECORDING THEM,

00:01:31.688 --> 00:01:32.754
OF COURSE WE'RE GOING TO BE

00:01:32.755 --> 00:01:33.455
CONCERNED ABOUT THAT, AND OF

00:01:33.456 --> 00:01:35.023
COURSE WE ARE GOING TO BE

00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:36.959
CONCERNED THAT THE REPORTING --

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:38.794
IT IS NOW TIME.

00:01:38.795 --> 00:01:40.762
LAWYERS ARE ARGUING TO THE

00:01:40.763 --> 00:01:42.264
STATE, TO THE JUDGE, TRYING TO

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:43.365
GET A FEDERAL JUDGE TO DO TWO

00:01:43.366 --> 00:01:44.199
THINGS.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.235
ONE, THROUGHOUT STATE LAW WHEN

00:01:46.236 --> 00:01:47.936
IT COMES TO VOTER INTENT.

00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:49.771
THEY ARE GOING TO DO A MANUAL

00:01:49.772 --> 00:01:50.572
RECOUNT OF THE SENATE RACE FOR

00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:51.773
ALL OF THE BALLOTS THAT EITHER

00:01:51.774 --> 00:01:53.208
DIDN'T VOTE IN THE SENATE RACE

00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:53.942
WERE DOUBLE VOTED.

00:01:53.943 --> 00:01:55.844
AND THERE IS A VERY SPECIFIC LAW

00:01:55.845 --> 00:01:57.779
FOR WHAT VOTER INTENT IS.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.747
IF YOU CIRCLE RICK SCOTT OR BILL

00:01:58.748 --> 00:01:59.815
NELSON, THAT IS FINE, BUT YOU

00:01:59.816 --> 00:02:00.549
HAVE TO HAVE DONE IT THROUGHOUT

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:01.750
THE BALLOT.

00:02:01.751 --> 00:02:03.018
THE MACHINE WON'T READ IT.

00:02:03.019 --> 00:02:03.685
THEY WANT TO THROUGHOUT THAT

00:02:03.686 --> 00:02:05.754
STANDARD AND JUST LET IT BE -- I

00:02:05.755 --> 00:02:06.555
DON'T KNOW WHAT.

00:02:06.556 --> 00:02:08.357
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CAN YOU CHANGE THE

00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:09.558
STANDARD AFTER THE VOTERS?

00:02:09.559 --> 00:02:10.826
&gt;&gt; THAT'S MY CONCERN.

00:02:10.827 --> 00:02:11.560
YOU SAY THERE'S A PROBLEM WITH

00:02:11.561 --> 00:02:12.828
THE LAWSUIT, THE LEGISLATOR IS

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:13.128
THERE.

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:13.962
BUT HAVE A JUDGE COMING AND I

00:02:13.963 --> 00:02:15.898
AND ALSO FLORIDA LAW AFTER THE

00:02:15.899 --> 00:02:17.799
ELECTION, WE'RE GOING TO CHANGE

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:18.967
THE RULES, IN HOPES OF

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.569
INFLUENCING THE OUTCOME, THAT,

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.371
TO ME, IS STEALING THE ELECTION.

00:02:22.372 --> 00:02:23.739
THEY ALSO WANT TO FORCE THEM TO

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.574
COUNT EVERY MAIL BALLOT, EVEN

00:02:25.575 --> 00:02:26.708
THE ONE ON WHICH THE SIGNATURE

00:02:26.709 --> 00:02:28.143
DIDN'T MATCH THE SIGNATURE ON

00:02:28.144 --> 00:02:30.179
FILE FOR THE VOTER.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.747
THESE ARE THE TWO FUNDAMENTAL

00:02:31.748 --> 00:02:32.147
ARGUMENTS.

00:02:32.148 --> 00:02:33.148
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT IS THE

00:02:33.149 --> 00:02:34.216
REQUIREMENT, THAT THE SIGNATURE

00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:34.983
HAS TO MATCH.

00:02:34.984 --> 00:02:35.984
THAT IS THE EXISTING

00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:36.885
REQUIREMENT, HOW CAN THEY ARGUE

00:02:36.886 --> 00:02:38.954
IT IS NO LONGER THE REQUIREMENT?

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:41.523
&gt;&gt; THEY SAY IS ARBITRARY

00:02:41.524 --> 00:02:41.890
STANDARD.

00:02:41.891 --> 00:02:42.958
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT THAT WAS THE

00:02:42.959 --> 00:02:43.859
STANDARD ON ELECTION DAY?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:44.760
&gt;&gt; CORRECT.

00:02:44.761 --> 00:02:46.128
THAT I'M HOPING A

00:02:46.129 --> 00:02:47.129
REASONABLE JUDGE WILL ARGUE,

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:47.896
THAT IS A GOOD POINT, HE SHOULD

00:02:47.897 --> 00:02:51.533
HAVE ERASED A MIKE RASOR

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:52.367
BEFORE THE ELECTION.

00:02:52.368 --> 00:02:53.268
WE ARE NOT GOING TO CHANGE THE

00:02:53.269 --> 00:02:55.304
RULES OF THE ELECTION AFTER THE

00:02:55.305 --> 00:02:56.338
ELECTION TO INFLUENCE THE

00:02:56.339 --> 00:02:58.407
OUTCOME, BECAUSE IF YOU DO, THAT

00:02:58.408 --> 00:02:59.141
IS STEALING AN ELECTION PAIRED

00:02:59.142 --> 00:03:00.943
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMAZING.

00:03:00.944 --> 00:03:02.844
SO, I WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT THE

00:03:02.845 --> 00:03:04.346
QUESTION OF NATIONALISM PAIRED

00:03:04.347 --> 00:03:05.080
THE PRESIDENT DESCRIBED HIMSELF

00:03:05.081 --> 00:03:06.048
AS A NATIONALIST, RECENTLY, TALK

00:03:06.049 --> 00:03:07.950
BY THE LEADER OF FRANCE FOR

00:03:07.951 --> 00:03:10.352
DOING THAT, HE RECENTLY

00:03:10.353 --> 00:03:11.353
PUBLISHED A

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:12.020
"WALL STREET JOURNAL" OP-ED

00:03:12.021 --> 00:03:13.555
DEFENDING THE IDEA OF

00:03:13.556 --> 00:03:15.157
NATIONALISM.

00:03:15.158 --> 00:03:17.326
WHY IS NATIONALISM A NECESSARY

00:03:17.327 --> 00:03:18.760
CONCEPT IN MODERN AMERICA?

00:03:18.761 --> 00:03:19.428
&gt;&gt; AMERICAN NATIONALISM.

00:03:19.429 --> 00:03:22.364
WHAT IS OUR IDENTITY?

00:03:22.365 --> 00:03:25.300
IF NOT A COMMON RACE, ETHNICITY,

00:03:25.301 --> 00:03:26.034
AMERICA IS A DE FACTO REJECTION

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:27.970
OF THAT.

00:03:27.971 --> 00:03:29.171
IT IS FUNDAMENTAL HE PROMISED ON

00:03:29.172 --> 00:03:30.672
THIS NOTION, WE ARE ALL CHILDREN

00:03:30.673 --> 00:03:32.374
OF GOD, WE ARE ALL BORN -- ALL

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:33.275
CREATED EQUAL BY OUR CREATOR,

00:03:33.276 --> 00:03:37.379
AND GIVEN EQUAL RIGHTS, LIFE,

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.848
LIBERTY, AND PURSUING HAPPINESS.

00:03:39.849 --> 00:03:41.183
IT IS DEEPLY ROOTED IN MORALS

00:03:41.184 --> 00:03:41.750
AND VALUES.

00:03:41.751 --> 00:03:43.352
IN FACT, AND EXPLAIN EVERYTHING

00:03:43.353 --> 00:03:45.354
THIS NATION HAS DONE,

00:03:45.355 --> 00:03:45.887
INTERNATIONALLY AND

00:03:45.888 --> 00:03:46.321
DOMESTICALLY.

00:03:46.322 --> 00:03:47.389
WE SHOULD BE PROUD OF THAT

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:47.756
IDENTITY.

00:03:47.757 --> 00:03:49.558
WE SHOULD DEFEND THAT.

00:03:49.559 --> 00:03:51.360
AT NUMBER TWO, I THINK MOST OF

00:03:51.361 --> 00:03:52.027
THE VIEWERS WATCHING THIS

00:03:52.028 --> 00:03:54.329
PROGRAM WOULD BE SHOCKED TO THIK

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.764
THAT MY JOB IS TO REPRESENT

00:03:55.765 --> 00:03:57.933
BELGIUM, OR MY JOB IS TO

00:03:57.934 --> 00:03:58.934
REPRESENT -- I HAVE NOTHING

00:03:58.935 --> 00:03:59.568
AGAINST BELGIUM.

00:03:59.569 --> 00:04:00.736
I ALWAYS PICK ON BELGIUM OR

00:04:00.737 --> 00:04:02.471
LUXEMBOURG, THEY HAVE THEIR OWN

00:04:02.472 --> 00:04:03.372
SYSTEM OF GOVERNMENT.

00:04:03.373 --> 00:04:04.606
THAT DOESN'T MEAN I NEED TO BE

00:04:04.607 --> 00:04:05.173
HOSTILE TOWARD THEM.

00:04:05.174 --> 00:04:06.408
IT MAY BE IN OUR NATIONAL

00:04:06.409 --> 00:04:07.976
INTEREST TO WORK WITH THEM.

00:04:07.977 --> 00:04:10.145
I THINK NATO IS IN OUR NATIONAL

00:04:10.146 --> 00:04:10.545
INTEREST.

00:04:10.546 --> 00:04:11.346
I THINK A LOT OF OUR ALLIANCES

00:04:11.347 --> 00:04:11.880
ARE BUILT ON THAT.

00:04:11.881 --> 00:04:16.351
IN FACT, OUR NATIONAL IDENTITY

00:04:16.352 --> 00:04:17.152
AS A NATION THAT BELIEVES IN

00:04:17.153 --> 00:04:18.387
EQUALITY OF ALL PEOPLE, IT IS

00:04:18.388 --> 00:04:22.357
WHAT IS CAUSED TO DEFEND

00:04:22.358 --> 00:04:23.058
DEMOCRACY ALL OVER THE WORLD.

00:04:23.059 --> 00:04:24.960
WE SHOULD BE PROUD OF THAT.

00:04:24.961 --> 00:04:26.995
BUT AS A GOVERNMENT LEADER, MY

00:04:26.996 --> 00:04:28.297
FUNDAMENTAL OBLIGATION FIRST AND

00:04:28.298 --> 00:04:29.731
FOREMOST IS TO WORK ON BEHALF OF

00:04:29.732 --> 00:04:30.265
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:04:30.266 --> 00:04:31.466
ON MOST OF THE TIME, IF NOT ALL

00:04:31.467 --> 00:04:33.368
OF THE TIME, WE CAN DO THAT

00:04:33.369 --> 00:04:34.670
WITHOUT HURTING OTHER PEOPLE

00:04:34.671 --> 00:04:35.203
AROUND THE WORLD.

00:04:35.204 --> 00:04:35.971
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT IS HARD TO KNOW

00:04:35.972 --> 00:04:37.272
THE ARGUMENT AGAINST WHAT YOU

00:04:37.273 --> 00:04:38.974
JUST SAID MIGHT BE.

00:04:38.975 --> 00:04:40.676
WHY WOULD PEOPLE OF JACK --

00:04:40.677 --> 00:04:41.877
SINCERELY, IT IS IMPORTANT TO

00:04:41.878 --> 00:04:43.945
UNDERSTAND WHAT THE OBJECTIONS

00:04:43.946 --> 00:04:45.347
ARE.

00:04:45.348 --> 00:04:47.749
&gt;&gt; THEY ASCRIBE TO NATIONALISM,

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.318
SORT OF THE NATIONALISM OF THE,

00:04:49.319 --> 00:04:50.385
OR SOMEBODY ELSE.

00:04:50.386 --> 00:04:51.920
THAT IS ETHNIC, RACIAL

00:04:51.921 --> 00:04:52.321
NATIONALISM.

00:04:52.322 --> 00:04:53.522
I'M NOT TALKING ABOUT ETHNIC

00:04:53.523 --> 00:04:55.557
NATIONALISM COME ON TALKING A

00:04:55.558 --> 00:04:57.092
NATIONAL IDENTITY THAT ACTUALLY

00:04:57.093 --> 00:04:57.959
IS COMPLETELY RELEVANT TO YOUR

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.327
ETHNICITY.

00:04:58.328 --> 00:04:59.094
IN FACT, YOU DON'T EVEN HAVE TO

00:04:59.095 --> 00:05:01.730
BE BORN HERE, YOU COME HERE

00:05:01.731 --> 00:05:02.764
LEGALLY, YOU CAN BE A U.S.

00:05:02.765 --> 00:05:03.565
CITIZEN.

00:05:03.566 --> 00:05:04.366
ONE OF THE GREAT THINGS ABOUT

00:05:04.367 --> 00:05:04.700
AMERICA.

00:05:04.701 --> 00:05:06.735
SOME OF THE PEOPLE WHO LOVE

00:05:06.736 --> 00:05:07.736
AMERICA THE MOST ARE THE PEOPLE

00:05:07.737 --> 00:05:08.570
WHO ARE AMERICANS BY CHOICE BEER

00:05:08.571 --> 00:05:10.005
THEY KNOW WHAT LIFE IS LIKE

00:05:10.006 --> 00:05:10.939
ANOTHER COUNTRY THERE THERE IS

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.341
ANOTHER SCHOOL OF THOUGHT THAT

00:05:12.342 --> 00:05:14.543
NO, WE ARE CITIZENS OF THE

00:05:14.544 --> 00:05:15.177
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY.

00:05:15.178 --> 00:05:16.745
AND WE HAVE OBLIGATIONS TO THE

00:05:16.746 --> 00:05:17.546
REST OF THE WORLD.

00:05:17.547 --> 00:05:19.548
WHICH, I WOULD AGREE, WITHIN THE

00:05:19.549 --> 00:05:20.182
CONFINES OF OUR NATIONAL

00:05:20.183 --> 00:05:20.549
INTERESTS.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.316
IN FACT, I'VE ALWAYS ARGUED THAT

00:05:21.317 --> 00:05:23.318
THE BEST THING FOR THE WORLD IS

00:05:23.319 --> 00:05:24.186
A STRONG AND PROSPEROUS AMERICA,

00:05:24.187 --> 00:05:27.956
BECAUSE OUR VALUES INFUSE OUR

00:05:27.957 --> 00:05:28.423
DECISION-MAKING.

00:05:28.424 --> 00:05:30.158
AND SO MUCH OF WHAT WE DO.

00:05:30.159 --> 00:05:32.027
SO THERE ARE PEOPLE -- I THINK

00:05:32.028 --> 00:05:34.529
THAT IS WHAT MACRON IS ARGUING.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.731
THAT FRANCE'S OBLIGATION COME

00:05:35.732 --> 00:05:37.566
UNDER HIM, ANYWAYS, NOT JUST TO

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:38.867
THE FRENCH PEOPLE, BUT TO    TOT

00:05:38.868 --> 00:05:39.968
THE FRENCH PEOPLE, BUT TO    TOE

00:05:39.969 --> 00:05:40.769
AMORPHOUS INTERNATIONAL

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.136
COMMUNITY.

00:05:41.137 --> 00:05:43.638
WHICH I'M NOT AGAINST, I DEFEND

00:05:43.639 --> 00:05:44.439
THE NATIONAL ORGANIZATION, SO

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.407
LONG AS THEY ARE IN THE NATIONAL

00:05:45.408 --> 00:05:47.409
INTEREST OF THE UNITED STATES.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.911
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BECAUSE THAT IS THE

00:05:49.912 --> 00:05:50.512
COUNTRY REPRESENT.

00:05:50.513 --> 00:05:51.146
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:05:51.147 --> 00:05:53.548
I SWORE MY ALLEGIANCE, THE OATH,

00:05:53.549 --> 00:05:54.616
I SWORE AN OATH TO THE

00:05:54.617 --> 00:05:55.150
CONSTITUTION OF THE

00:05:55.151 --> 00:05:55.751
UNITED STATES.

00:05:55.752 --> 00:05:57.419
I WORK FOR THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.254
AND I BELIEVE I CAN DO SO WHILE

00:05:59.255 --> 00:05:59.988
STILL BEING STRONG ALLIES OF

00:05:59.989 --> 00:06:02.924
JAPAN, STRONG ALLIES OF

00:06:02.925 --> 00:06:03.658
GREAT BRITAIN, STRONG ALLIES OF

00:06:03.659 --> 00:06:07.329
COUNTRIES ALL AROUND THE WORLD.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.029
ESPECIALLY WHEN OUR INTERESTS

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:08.397
INTERSECT.

00:06:08.398 --> 00:06:09.531
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I THINK THIS IS A

00:06:09.532 --> 00:06:11.534
VITAL CONVERSATION, AND I'M GLAD

